ft ucode
absent ucodeRegex   # neither the URL nor the divisions inside comments

1 1 ucodeCommentLine     # apostrophe inside a line comment
1 40 ucodeCommentLine
2 40 ucodeCommentLine    # http:// inside a line comment
3 40 ucodeCommentLine    # a / b / c inside a line comment
4 1 ucodeCommentBlock
5 25 ucodeCommentBlock   # quotes inside a block comment
6 4 ucodeTodo            # TODO
8 12 ucodeCommentLine
8 15 ucodeTodo           # FIXME
9 1 ucodeCommentBlock    # block comment closed mid-line
9 25 ucodeDeclaration    # and code resuming after it
